Screenshots off a real device live here, and ARE committed: a picture of a run
somebody actually did cannot be regenerated, and an App Store asset that exists
on one laptop is a liability rather than an asset.

Name them so the checker knows what they are:
  listing-*.png   6.9in listing screenshots, 1320x2868 or 1290x2796

No marketing icon belongs here: App Store Connect takes it from the build.
icon-1024.png in this folder is the OLD mark, from before 2026-09-11. Do not
upload it.
